Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.77,0:00:09.57,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)\fs(100)\pos(960,800)\bord3\blur2}- 1863 Tibet -
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.77,0:00:09.57,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)\fs(100)\pos(960,800)}- 1863 Tibet -
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.78,0:00:23.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For three years you have endured\Nand survived our training.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.72,0:00:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can run for unimaginable\Ndistances and not be short of breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.04,0:00:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon you will be ready\Nto begin the intense
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.22,0:00:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,training that we call the Celestial Gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.28,0:00:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I warn you again, Zeppeli.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.26,0:00:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If your choice is to continue with these\Nteachings, you will be sealing your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.42,0:00:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time to turn back\Nis now. You're young.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.92,0:00:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can start a new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.94,0:00:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Tonpetty, read\Nthe waves of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.82,0:00:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me how long I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When is this life of mine going to end?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.22,0:01:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where does it end?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.88,0:01:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does it end?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.88,0:01:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you want this knowledge?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.60,0:01:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe there is a purpose to my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.34,0:01:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One that I cannot set aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.16,0:01:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to know so I can\Nfulfill that purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.46,0:01:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I know how much time I have to accomplish\Nit, then I can accept the outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.24,0:01:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.62,0:01:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, let it be done if\Nthat is what you believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.76,0:01:50.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In an ancient chamber\Nhidden from the light and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.64,0:01:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,reeking of death a child\Nshall open the way for You
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.12,0:01:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to unchain a young lion\Nand release him into the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.46,0:02:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,future of his destiny you\Nwill burn your own Wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.22,0:02:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then freely Will you open your arms\NTo the cruel death that awaits? you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.18,0:02:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baron Zeppeli, be careful? my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.16,0:02:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I come, Jojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.18,0:02:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To unchain a young lion and release?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.66,0:02:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him into the future of his destiny.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.05,0:02:49.18,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sora! Koboreochita futatsu no hoshi ga
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.05,0:02:49.18,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Two stars fall from the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.05,0:02:49.18,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sora koboreochita futatsu no hoshi ga
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.26,0:02:56.85,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hikari to yami no minamo suikomareteyuku
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.26,0:02:56.85,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,One shining in the light, the other sinking into darkness
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.85,0:03:02.28,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hikiau you ni kasanaru hamon
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.85,0:03:02.28,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,A ripple drawing the two of them together
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.68,0:03:09.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you. I love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.70,0:03:13.33,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hokori no michi wo yuku mono ni taiyo no michibiki wo
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.70,0:03:13.33,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,One will walk the path of pride and receive the sun's guidance
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.70,0:03:13.33,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hokori no michi wo yuku mono ni taiyou no michibiki wo
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.33,0:03:19.46,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yabou no hate wo mezasu mono ni
Dialogue: 1,0:03:13.33,0:03:19.46,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,One will walk the path of unbridled ambition...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.46,0:03:20.88,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ikenie wo!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.46,0:03:20.88,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Demanding sacrifice!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.46,0:03:20.88,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ikenie wo
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.72,0:03:31.60,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Furueru hodo kokoro moetsukiru hodo atsuku
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.72,0:03:31.60,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Let that burning in your soul calm the trembling of your heart
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.60,0:03:34.93,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sono te kara hanate kodou
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.60,0:03:34.93,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,Strike down your fears,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.66,0:03:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just had a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make you move on my Pode.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.93,0:03:38.39,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Karada minagiru yuki de
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.93,0:03:38.39,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,With courage coursing through your veins!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.93,0:03:38.39,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Karada minagiru yuuki de
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.39,0:03:45.07,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mayoi naki kakugo ni kassai wo
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.39,0:03:45.07,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,You cannot overcome your pain unless you can accept...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.39,0:03:45.07,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mayou naki kakugo ni kassai wo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.58,0:03:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not that you're only a good cuz.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.44,0:03:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the future.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.07,0:03:49.07,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sono chi no sadame!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.07,0:03:49.07,Lyrics OP1 Eng,,0,0,0,,The legacy of your bloodline!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.07,0:03:49.07,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Sono chi no sadame
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.07,0:03:52.87,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,JoJo!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.07,0:03:52.87,Lyrics OP1 Jap,,0,0,0,,Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judge You!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.72,0:04:09.47,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\fad(700,0)\pos(1345,830)\bord3.5\blur2}Episode 7: "The Successor"
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.72,0:04:09.47,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\fad(700,0)\pos(1345,830)}Episode 7: "Sorrowful Successor"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.84,0:04:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't fudge this collar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.64,0:04:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.74,0:04:25.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tarkus hasn't made a display of his\Ntricks for fighting in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.28,0:04:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That worries me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.10,0:04:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to me, fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think your hormone will do any good?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.66,0:04:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little bugs can't lay a finger on\Nme, no matter how hard you may try!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.16,0:04:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You afraid to go to Africa yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.90,0:04:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Masterfully played, Baron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.38,0:05:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go, how about\Nthis, Tornado Overdrive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.54,0:05:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch your back!
