Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.20,0:06:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.18,0:06:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.30,0:06:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Dio, as you ordered,\Nthey're dead, both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.94,0:06:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.48,0:06:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This bloody savagery is unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.50,0:06:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jonathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even with a broken neck, you have\Nthe poor taste to still be alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.24,0:07:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.50,0:07:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jo... Jojo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.22,0:07:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lively for only half a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.08,0:07:20.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freely I give this...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.06,0:07:23.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freely I give this...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.08,0:07:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Freely I give this to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My ultimate technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.54,0:07:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.54,0:07:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultimate Deep Pass Overdrive!
