Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.30,0:08:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.06,0:08:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.98,0:09:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hauled Tarkus off the\Nground like a sack of turnips!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.20,0:09:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as if the Baron's hormone\Nhealed his broken neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.48,0:09:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Numskull, you actually think\Nyou can yank that collar open?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pathetic waste of flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.84,0:09:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't pull apart\Nthose steel bands even
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.38,0:09:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with all the power\Ngiven to me by Lord Neo!
