Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.30,0:09:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jonathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.76,0:09:35.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bug! How's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.70,0:09:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twisted by madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.36,0:09:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, no human feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.68,0:09:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gave up your redemption when\Nyou chose to follow Dio, Tarkus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that, his hormones visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.58,0:10:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His body can barely contain its strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.36,0:10:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Baron's Hormone joined and\Nmultiplied incredibly with Jonathan's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.84,0:10:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's been nothing like this ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.66,0:10:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tarkus, you cannot be allowed\Nto continue. This is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.38,0:10:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your evil spirit must be banished.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.94,0:10:27.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your time is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.66,0:10:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'll erase you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.80,0:10:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough of your blather.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.34,0:10:32.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You talk too much.
