Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.66,0:10:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cairo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cairo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.94,0:10:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cairo! Cairo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.85,0:10:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cairo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.77,0:10:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well played!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.14,0:11:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Berencippoli!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.46,0:11:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speak to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.86,0:11:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.38,0:11:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so terribly wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without you beside me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.92,0:11:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without your wisdom and guidance, how\Nwill I make my way through this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.38,0:11:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, you simply must\Npull yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.90,0:11:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've no time to waste now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.64,0:11:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what lies ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.34,0:12:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go, leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.00,0:12:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Settle accounts with Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.42,0:12:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first of all, you must\Ndestroy the mask separately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.36,0:12:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.58,0:12:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.76,0:12:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.44,0:12:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have lived my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.62,0:12:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was young, I was\Nvery happily married.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But to pursue the mask,\NI left my family behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.14,0:12:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, I've never\Nregretted the choice I made.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.34,0:12:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I accept it completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.18,0:12:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.42,0:12:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, I can see that\Nmy choice was the right one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.46,0:13:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, you are my deliverance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.10,0:13:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baron Zeppelin
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.62,0:13:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems to me that in you I have found\Nboth a best friend and a new family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.52,0:13:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo, through you I will live on forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My son, Jojo
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.08,0:13:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 19th century novelist\NWilliam Makepeace Thackeray wrote
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.68,0:13:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To love and win is the best thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.78,0:13:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To love and lose is the next best
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.90,0:13:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so it was that Jojo took\Nup his mentor's life quest,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.10,0:14:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as well as his spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.76,0:14:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.34,0:14:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.56,0:14:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg you, please don't bring\Nno harm to my child. Let him be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.30,0:14:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I comprehend you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us clarify what you desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.22,0:14:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voluntarily, you will give yourself to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.86,0:14:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the condition that\Nwe not touch your child.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.16,0:14:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that accurate?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.46,0:14:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.68,0:14:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only don't hurt my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.32,0:14:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You move me to tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.58,0:14:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.49,0:15:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shall have your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.44,0:15:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hereby swear that neither I nor any of\Nmy servants will bring harm to your child.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.46,0:15:10.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, you need to\Nbe aware of one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.86,0:15:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All my minions, without exception,\Nwillingly gave up their souls for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.14,0:15:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I truly think it would work out far\Nbetter if both of you were to join me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There would be no more worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.84,0:15:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You would both be part of\Na new and greater family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.98,0:15:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, you promised\Nnot to hurt my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.06,0:15:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.06,0:15:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So be it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.54,0:15:49.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweet little child.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.56,0:15:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As promised, we've not harmed the child.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.02,0:15:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's something you've\Ntaken care of on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.72,0:16:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The irony is lost on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:06.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Struth, Jonathan's demeanour is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.12,0:16:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if the shutters were drawn on his soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the same for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got no time for tears, only anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There'll be plenty of time to\Ncry once we've dealt with Dio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oi, Jonathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.28,0:16:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio was swarming about, saying he'd\Nwipe out the town by tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.04,0:16:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zombies will multiply, like\Nrats breeding in a refuse heap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.94,0:16:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No telling what's been\Ngoing on down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.78,0:16:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is Wind Knight's lot alive or United?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.22,0:16:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My sister, is she all right? Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.18,0:17:07.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Adams!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.78,0:17:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Pogo, what are you doing at this\Nhour of the night wandering the moors?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.70,0:17:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.82,0:17:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is everyone alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.14,0:17:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my sister, is she safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.26,0:17:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dare to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.62,0:17:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean to say, you really don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.48,0:17:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's bloody furious!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.34,0:17:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you get home, she's going to lock\Nyou in the barn and turn your hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.26,0:17:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that means she's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.60,0:17:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.56,0:17:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.86,0:17:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Adams.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.66,0:17:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A nice young child.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.08,0:17:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a taste for some fresh, warm blood.
