Dialogue: 2,0:18:52.98,0:18:53.02,SFXPurp3,16,0,0,0,,{=27}{\bord0\blur0.6\frz24.68\pos(496.1,435.83)\4a&HFF&}Shock
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.22,0:18:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.80,0:18:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thunder split attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you madman?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.14,0:19:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A normal man would pull back,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.56,0:19:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but instead you went on the offensive\Nand attacked me with a headbutt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.86,0:19:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.44,0:19:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jonathan Joestar, I am human.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.18,0:19:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.50,0:19:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.16,0:19:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to see how\Nwell Zeppeli had trained you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.06,0:19:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.97,0:19:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say Zeppeli?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.18,0:19:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard correctly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.06,0:19:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zeppeli is a dear old friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.56,0:19:34.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have been through many trials\Ntogether over the past 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.46,0:19:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.74,0:19:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, my name is Straitzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.20,0:19:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please read this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.16,0:19:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.26,0:19:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was written by...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.48,0:19:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baron Zeppeli!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.28,0:19:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've only just arrived, but he sent\Nthat some time ago, requesting our aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wrote about the stone\Nmask, where it could be found,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.96,0:19:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and especially about the man who wears it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.46,0:20:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.12,0:20:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.32,0:20:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our training master, Tonpetty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.56,0:20:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greetings to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.96,0:20:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're Baron Zeppeli's\Nteacher, Master Tonpetty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.30,0:20:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the region I call home, our\Ncustom is not to shake hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.80,0:20:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this way, we greet each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.48,0:20:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.22,0:20:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zeppeli should be here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.66,0:21:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.80,0:21:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zeppeli has passed beyond the Vale.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.90,0:21:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we had arrived earlier, his\Nfate would still have been the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.08,0:21:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His death is proof that the strength\Nthis Dio wields is devastating.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.80,0:21:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His wickedness and his power\Nare quite extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.68,0:21:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.18,0:21:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've put this town in my\Nthrall in but a single night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.44,0:22:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout.\NThe words will make
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.72,0:22:14.31,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.31,0:22:17.85,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,The words will make you out 'n' out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.96,0:22:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You out and out. I'll\Nspend the day your way.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.85,0:22:23.19,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.02,0:22:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it morning, driving through\Nthe sun. And in and out the valley.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.19,0:22:25.86,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.86,0:22:30.37,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.44,0:22:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The music dance and sing They make the
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.83,0:22:41.42,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,The music dance and sing
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.42,0:22:44.96,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,They make the children really ring
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.30,0:22:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,children really ring I\Nspend the day your way
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.96,0:22:50.30,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,I'll spend the day your way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.08,0:22:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call it morning, driving through\Nthe sun. And in and out the valley
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.30,0:22:52.93,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Call it morning driving through the sound and
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.93,0:22:56.98,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and out the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.78,0:22:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In and around the lake
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.98,0:22:59.35,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,In and around the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.56,0:23:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the\Nsky. And they stand there.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.60,0:23:02.81,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Mountains come out of the sky
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.81,0:23:04.61,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,and they stand there
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.66,0:23:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One mile over, we'll be\Nthere and we'll see you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.74,0:23:11.41,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,One mile over we'll be there and we'll see you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.06,0:23:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten true summers. We'll\Nbe there and laughing too.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.20,0:23:17.87,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Ten true summers we'll be there and laughing too
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.58,0:23:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twenty-four. We'll be there and we'll\Nsee you. I'll be there with you!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.62,0:23:24.29,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,Twenty-four before my love you'll see I'll be
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.29,0:23:26.96,Lyrics 2,Yes,0,0,0,,There with you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.46,0:23:29.47,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs120\pos(960,700)\bord5.5\blur2}Next Episode
