Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.14,0:23:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run, run, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.86,0:23:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Falaford, it didn't, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.58,0:23:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straightzo's my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.84,0:23:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.96,0:23:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will feel no hint of\Nguilt for your death!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.30,0:23:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, JoJo!
